          "item": {
            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "Delhi HC Orders Removal of Deepfake Videos Falsely Showing MP Shashi Tharoor Praising Pakistan",
            "articleSection": "Policy & Rights",
            "abstract": "The Delhi High Court announced it would issue blocking orders against AI-generated deepfake videos falsely depicting Congress MP Shashi Tharoor praising Pakistan, after he filed a petition over the misuse of his identity. The case marks one of the most prominent Indian legal interventions involving political deepfakes during an active security-sensitive period. The ruling signals growing judicial willingness to act swiftly against AI-generated political disinformation in India.",
            "url": "https://www.medianama.com/2026/05/223-delhi-hc-pass-blocking-orders-shashi-tharoor-deepfakes-praising-pakistan/",
            "publisher": {
              "@type": "NewsMediaOrganization",
              "name": "The AI Chronicle",
